Subject: [PATCH] V0 update

VIDEO V0: measured baseline + docs/plans/VIDEO_PLAN.md.

Baseline measured 2026-10-10 on AuraLite-Emulator@39bd235 with
AuraLite-OS@0ed0d29. What the machine presents today: GPU PCI 0:2:0
(8086:0412, the sample firmware's probe target) with the VRAM/framebuffer
RAM window at 0xD0000000 (boot_info.fb + BOOT_MEM_FRAMEBUF + --dump-fb);
VGA text is absent (0xB8000 is plain RAM, CRTC 0x3D4/0x3D5 float high);
Bochs VBE is absent (0x1CE/0x1CF float high); no mode state exists.
What the guest expects (measured): fb.c's BIOS-path fallback writes
80x25 cells at 0xB8000 with attribute 0x07 and moves the cursor through
the CRTC index/data pair; stage2_start.asm forces VGA text mode 3 via
int 0x10; the QEMU recipes run -vga std (Bochs VBE dispi) and the guest's
own tables name PCI 1234:1111 QEMU/Bochs std VGA. Five measured defects
drive V1-V3 (text display path, CRTC, dispi, mode state, per-mode
display output).
